BMI Stellar is a privacy-first local companion: every health record is
computed and stored on the user's device, backups are encrypted with
AES-256-GCM + Argon2id, and no analytics touch the data path. The
release lanes — the Vercel deployment, the PWA offline shell, and the
repository source — ship the same source of truth (see verify.sh and
scripts/build.sh).

